\textbf{(b) Decrypt \texttt{KHOOR}, $k = 3$:}

$D(c) = (c - 3) \bmod 26$: K$(10) \to 7$(H), H$(7) \to 4$(E), O$(14) \to 11$(L),
O$(14) \to 11$(L), R$(17) \to 14$(O).

$\boxed{\texttt{KHOOR} \xrightarrow{k=3} \texttt{HELLO}}$ \textcolor{darkgreen}{\checkmark}

